src(16,'Lok Sabha debate: tobacco regulation bill','Lok Sabha; Indian Kanoon reproduction','https://indiankanoon.org/doc/929188/','2003-04-30','Parliamentary record','Opening motion and minister introduction; debate conclusion','As Health Minister Swaraj moved the tobacco regulation bill for consideration; described advertising restrictions, passive smoking and committee revisions. Debate concluded with passage. She traced earlier introduction to March 2001 and Rajya Sabha passage to April 2003.','Hindi original inspected and paraphrased in English. Parliamentary reproduction, not the signed statute. Implementation and later health effects are separate.',origin='LS-debate-2003-04-30')
