src(18,'Swaraj statement on Yemen evacuation','MEA / PIB','https://www.pib.gov.in/newsite/PrintRelease.aspx?lang=2&reg=48&relid=118364','2015-04-20','Speech / interview','Statement, role paragraphs and totals through 18 April','Reported evacuation of 4741 Indians and 1947 foreign nationals by 18 April. Swaraj spoke to Saudi counterpart and chaired coordination meetings; PM contacted Saudi King; V.K. Singh supervised from Djibouti; diplomatic staff, military, Air India and other agencies executed the operation.','Dated government counts, not a timeless final total or sole-minister achievement.')
