src(21,'For the love of no man’s land','New Indian Express / Sunday Standard','https://www.newindianexpress.com/thesundaystandard/2015/May/10/for-the-love-of-no-mans-land-758526.html','2015-05-10','Journalism','Parliament debate, diplomat assessments and Bengal negotiations','Describes Swaraj piloting Bangladesh boundary bill, unanimity in Parliament, prior BJP/Assam opposition and outreach to Mamata Banerjee over rehabilitation. Diplomats welcomed the debate.','Contemporaneous account with named and anonymous assessments; wider treaty history predates her ministry.')
