src(26,'Government defends Swaraj’s help to Lalit Modi','Indian Express','https://indianexpress.com/article/political-pulse/after-sunday-times-report-sushma-says-she-backed-lalit-modi-travel-documents-on-humanitarian-grounds/','2015-06-15','Journalism','Travel intervention, leaked correspondence and responses','Reported facilitation of UK travel documents and questions over personal links. Swaraj said she asked UK authorities to apply their rules without harming bilateral relations because Modi’s wife needed cancer treatment. UK Home Office said rules were followed.','The travel intervention is admitted; ethical criticism is not a judicial finding against Swaraj. Leaked correspondence originates with Sunday Times.',origin='IE-report-and-SundayTimes-2015')
