src(29,'Informed Parliament before families as protocol: Swaraj','Times of India','https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/39-indians-missing-in-iraq-killed-informed-parliament-before-families-as-per-protocol-says-sushma-swaraj/articleshow/63381443.cms','2018-03-20','Journalism','Announcement and minister’s defence','Confirmed 39 deaths; cited DNA evidence and said she needed concrete proof before declaring deaths. Defended informing Parliament first as her duty and rejected false-hope criticism.','The protocol explanation is her assertion; not independently established as a legal requirement. Her accusation against escapee Masih is not adopted.')
